entative token fixtures contain semantic labels and\n+  text/non-colour cues for status.\n+- Validate reduced-motion values remove nonessential transitions without\n+  suppressing essential information.\n+- Confirm focus, target-size, typography, spacing, and status tokens are\n+  semantic and do not encode a screen or final asset.\n+- Record GATE-0002 and GATE-0004 as retained before any numeric design,\n+  contrast, font, or breakpoint claim.\n+\n+## Evidence\n+\n+Preserve token-validation results, representative non-colour and\n+reduced-motion fixtures, and the explicit retained-gate record.\n+\n+## Acceptance criteria\n+\n+- Semantic tokens provide non-colour cues and reduced-motion values.\n+- The token contract can be consumed by web and PWA UI without platform forks.\n+- No final visual assets or approval-gated numeric claims are introduced.\n\ntokens used\n94,946\n", "adapter_log": "", "test_log": "B0002 focused manifest, ownership, provenance, dependency, section, and asset-boundary check passed; git diff --check passed.", "browser_log": "No browser check required; these are authoring contracts with browser_impact: not_applicable.", "screenshots": []}, "acceptance_results": [{"criterion": "R0002, R0003, and R0010 are the only outputs and each maps to its assigned IMP record.", "status": "pass", "evidence": "Focused validation found exactly R0002.md, R0003.md, and R0010.md in the project runbooks directory and verified mappings to IMP-0002, IMP-0003, and IMP-0010."}, {"criterion": "Each output is bounded, traceable, dependency-correct, and explicitly prohibits incidental asset work.", "status": "pass", "evidence": "Each contract has manifest-matched provenance and dependencies, bounded ownership/non-goals, and an Asset assessment explicitly prohibiting incidental product assets."}, {"criterion": "Metadata, required sections, and manifest ownership are structurally validated before checkpointing.", "status": "pass", "evidence": "Focused structural validation 